                      {m.metro === "NYC Metro" && "Manhattan UWS/UES corridor alone has 60+ customers in 6 adjacent zips. Scarsdale + Westchester adds another layer. Then NJ suburban zips (Manalapan, Morristown, Hoboken) form a second ring. Greenwich/New Canaan CT complete the tri-state cluster."}
